==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|inferiourity}} {{qualifier|obsolete|rare}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɒɹɪti|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|inferiorities}}

# The quality or state of being [[inferior]].
# An inferior [[value]] or [[quality]].
# An inferior [[power]].
#: ''She held an inferior rank in the [[hierarchy]].''
# The quality of being a competitive disadvantage.

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|superiority}}

